{
    "id": "components/confirmation-dialog",
    "title": "Confirmation Dialog",
    "description": "Ask for one native confirmation with explicit cancellation and destructive action semantics.",
    "group": "Components",
    "anchors": {
        "confirmation-dialog": "overview",
        "props-and-events": "props-and-events",
        "behavior-and-accessibility": "behavior-and-accessibility",
        "screenshots": "screenshots"
    },
    "chapters": {
        "overview": {
            "title": "Overview",
            "blocks": [
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Confirmation Dialog asks the user to confirm or cancel one consequential action using the platform's native presentation and action ordering."
                },
                {
                    "type": "code",
                    "language": "blade",
                    "text": "<firstlight:confirmation-dialog\n    :visible=\"$confirmingDeletion\"\n    title=\"Delete appointment?\"\n    message=\"This action cannot be undone.\"\n    confirm-label=\"Delete\"\n    cancel-label=\"Keep appointment\"\n    tone=\"destructive\"\n    @press=\"deleteAppointment\"\n    @dismiss=\"cancelDeletion\"\n/>"
                },
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "Both handlers should set "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "$confirmingDeletion",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": " to "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "false",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ". The confirmation handler also performs the action; the dismissal handler only cancels the request."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        "props-and-events": {
            "title": "Props and events",
            "blocks": [
                {
                    "type": "item",
                    "marker": "•",
                    "depth": 0,
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "visible",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ": server-controlled presentation request; defaults to "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "false",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "item",
                    "marker": "•",
                    "depth": 0,
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "title",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ": required visible heading and accessible dialog name."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "item",
                    "marker": "•",
                    "depth": 0,
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "message",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ": required explanation of the decision or consequence."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "item",
                    "marker": "•",
                    "depth": 0,
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "confirm-label",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ": confirmation action text; defaults to the package chrome string "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Confirm",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ". See "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Localize chrome",
                            "link": 0
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "item",
                    "marker": "•",
                    "depth": 0,
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "cancel-label",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ": cancellation action text; defaults to the package chrome string "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Cancel",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "item",
                    "marker": "•",
                    "depth": 0,
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "tone",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ": "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "default",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": " or "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "destructive",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "; defaults to "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "default",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "item",
                    "marker": "•",
                    "depth": 0,
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "@press",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ": required callback for explicit confirmation."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "item",
                    "marker": "•",
                    "depth": 0,
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "@dismiss",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ": required callback for cancellation, back, or outside dismissal."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "item",
                    "marker": "•",
                    "depth": 0,
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "class",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ": external EDGE layout only."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "The component always presents one confirm action and one cancel action. It does not support arbitrary action lists, icons, loading or disabled states, "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "native:model",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ", per-platform styling, or an undismissable mode. Use "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Alert Dialog",
                            "link": 1
                        },
                        {
                            "text": " when the user only needs to acknowledge a message."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        "behavior-and-accessibility": {
            "title": "Behavior and accessibility",
            "blocks": [
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "One user outcome produces one callback. Programmatic closure produces none. After a user dismisses the dialog, copy-only publications do not reopen it; a later server transition from "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "false",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": " to "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "true",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": " presents a new decision."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "runs": [
                        {
                            "text": "iOS uses a UIKit action sheet ("
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "UIAlertController",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "); Android uses Material 3 "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "AlertDialog",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": ". Their native controls own modal focus, action order, destructive expression, Dynamic Type or font scaling, dark appearance, contrast, reduced motion, and right-to-left behavior. Use specific action labels such as "
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Delete",
                            "code": true
                        },
                        {
                            "text": " rather than generic text when the consequence can be named."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
